        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The returned function:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>On systems <bold>with</bold> HIP: selects <computeroutput>device_index</computeroutput>, then executes the work item. Kernel blob dispatch via <computeroutput>.hsaco</computeroutput> is a hardware-only feature; on a device without loaded kernels the call succeeds (no-op kernel).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>On systems <bold>without</bold> HIP: returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> immediately (CPU path).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The function is safe to move into <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_launcher" kindref="compound">GPULauncher</ref></computeroutput> or <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_stream_manager_1a83dffcca0034f2aa1337b697ec83fbf8" kindref="member">GPUStreamManager::createStream()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>device_index</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Target HIP device index (0-based). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
